Chapter: EdgeMeshPrewarm

  cites Engine chapter EdgeMesh
  cites Net chapter GroupMembership
  cites Mesh chapter EdgeMeshLive
  cites Mesh chapter EdgeMeshPlace
  cites Mesh chapter EdgeMeshFederate

 `EdgeMeshGameServers.md` phase 4, stage 3: pre-warming. `fleet-spawn` spawns
 on demand and nothing spawns ahead of one, so the first players of a filling
 lane wait for a boot.

 A PLAN COUNTS WHAT IS ALREADY WARM. A plan reading the queue alone spawns the
 whole demand on every tick, and a fleet grows without bound while every single
 tick reads as correct.

Section: What Is Already Warm

  prewarm-ready : GroupState, EdgeRegion, Text -> Integer
  prewarm-ready (g) (r) (game) =
    mesh-healthy-count (gs-find-service g (place-game-service game r)) 0 0

  prewarm-matches : Integer -> Integer
  prewarm-matches (waiting) = waiting / 2

Section: The Plan

  PrewarmPlan = record {
    pp-region : Text,
    pp-ready : Integer,
    pp-waiting : Integer,
    pp-spawn : Integer,
    pp-why : Text
  }

  prewarm-decide : EdgeRegion, Integer, Integer -> PrewarmPlan
  prewarm-decide (r) (ready) (waiting) =
    let want = prewarm-matches waiting - ready
    in let room = (r.er-capacity) - ready
    in let capped = if want > room then room else want
    in let spawn = if capped < 0 then 0 else capped
    in PrewarmPlan {
      pp-region = r.er-name,
      pp-ready = ready,
      pp-waiting = waiting,
      pp-spawn = spawn,
      pp-why = if want <= 0 then "already warm" else if want > room then "capped by capacity" else "demand"
    }

  prewarm-plan : GroupState, RegionList, Integer, FedQueue, Text -> PrewarmPlan
  prewarm-plan (g) (rl) (idx) (q) (game) =
    when mesh-region-at rl idx
      is None -> PrewarmPlan { pp-region = "none", pp-ready = 0, pp-waiting = 0, pp-spawn = 0, pp-why = "no such region" }
      is Just (r) -> prewarm-decide r (prewarm-ready g r game) (fed-waiting q game)

Section: Reporting

  prewarm-label : PrewarmPlan -> Text
  prewarm-label (p) =
    (p.pp-region) & ": waiting " & show (p.pp-waiting) & ", warm " & show (p.pp-ready) & ", spawn " & show (p.pp-spawn) & ", " & (p.pp-why)
